  <p id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p001:m0000" ref="ae2_620_2bc">袁渙</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p001:m0003" ref="ae2_620_2bc">曜卿</persName>，陳郡扶樂人也。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p002:m0000" ref="ae2_620_2bc">渙</persName>子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p002:m0002" ref="ev9_lyp_ry2">侃</persName>，亦清粹閑素，有父風，歷位郡守尚書。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">《袁氏世紀》曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p003:m0008" ref="ae2_620_2bc">渙</persName>有四子，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p003:m0013" ref="ev9_lyp_ry2">侃</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p003:m0015" ref="ae2_620_2bc_A">㝢</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p003:m0017" ref="7oq_6nv_85l">奧</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-sgz11:p003:m0019" ref="ae2_620_2bc_B">準</persName>。</p>
</text>
